#: ../src/greeter-login-page.c:1052
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Authentication Failure\n"
"\n"
"You have %s login attempts remaining.\n"
"You can no longer log in when the maximum number of login attempts is "
"exceeded."
msgstr ""
"로그인 실패 (사용자 인증 오류)\n"
"\n"
"로그인 시도 가능 횟수가 %s회 남았습니다.\n"
